flowchart LR
    Client[Website / Form / API client] -->|POST booking request| Webhook

    subgraph Main["Barbershop Booking API"]
        Webhook --> Collect[Collect and trim fields]
        Collect --> Required{Required fields present?}
        Required -->|No| R400A[400 Missing fields]
        Required -->|Yes| Secret{Secret valid?}
        Secret -->|No| R401[401 Wrong secret]
        Secret -->|Yes| Validation[Execute Validation workflow]
        Validation --> Phone{Phone valid?}
        Phone -->|No| R400B[400 Invalid phone]
        Phone -->|Yes| Key[Create booking_key]
        Key --> Lookup[Lookup booking_key in Google Sheets]
        Lookup --> Duplicate{Booking exists?}
        Duplicate -->|Yes| R200D[200 Booking already exists]
        Duplicate -->|No| Append[Append booking to Google Sheets]
        Append --> R200C[200 Booking created]
        R200C -->|Do not wait| Notifications
    end

    subgraph Notifications["Barbershop Notifications"]
        Notifications --> TG[Notify manager in Telegram]
        TG --> EmailCheck{Valid email present?}
        EmailCheck -->|Yes| Gmail[Send confirmation email]
        EmailCheck -->|No| Done[Finish]
        Gmail --> Done
    end

    subgraph Errors["Centralized Error Handler"]
        ErrorTrigger[Error Trigger] --> ErrorLog[Append error to Google Sheets]
        ErrorLog --> Alert[Send Telegram alert]
    end

    Main -. unexpected failure .-> ErrorTrigger
    Notifications -. unexpected failure .-> ErrorTrigger
